    "detailed_description": "Faced with a horrifying tragedy, you must delve into a flowering realm of memories and nightmares to save your dead lover. SYSTEM PURGE - Hollow Point is a challenging, atmospheric, and action-packed 2D platformer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHOLLOW POINT<br />\r\nCloned flesh is no substitute; you\u2019ve saved no one real. Hollow Point continues the story of the first System Purge, adding six new surreal sectors to explore. Survive a litany of new obstacles and monstrous threats as you delve into the System\u2019s very foundations\u2026and beyond.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBEARTRAP MODE<br />\r\nAfter you've finished Hollow Point, tackle the game\u2019s hardest challenge in Beartrap Mode. Play through an alternate story which remixes and redesigns every level from the original game, adding new obstacles, new secrets, and 4 brutally difficult boss encounters.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSPEEDRUN MODE<br />\r\nPut your skills to the test in 2 new speedrun categories. Jumps, deaths, and uncovered secrets are now tracked during each run.",
